/*visual: comparison chart showing deployment independence-monolith has single deployment pipeline with all teams queuing, micro-frontends show parallel deployment pipelines with independent release cadences*/
/*visual: decision tree flowchart starting with "Team size?" branching to organizational structure questions, deployment frequency needs, and arriving at recommended architecture*/
/*visual: network waterfall diagram showing optimized micro-frontend loading with parallel fetches, shared dependency loading, and route-based code splitting*/
/*visual: deployment pipeline diagram showing micro-frontend with progressive rollout stages: build -> test -> deploy to 1% -> monitor -> 10% -> 50% -> 100%, with rollback arrows at each stage*/
